---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// BeP09 figure: BeP09Mutate
---
<figure class="bep9n7">
  <div class="bep9n7-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="Mutation check. Delete the rule that an unassigned case cannot be closed. The two weak tests stay green, since one mocks the service and the other checks only the 201. The suite from this post fails in three places at the unit and API layers, each naming the broken rule.">
    <rect x="20" y="110" width="230" height="84" rx="10" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="bug" x={55} y={152} size={24} />
    <text x="80" y="142" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>delete one rule</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>xóa một luật</tspan></text>
    <text x="80" y="164" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>"unassigned cannot</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>"case chưa gán không</tspan></text>
    <text x="80" y="182" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>be closed"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>được đóng"</tspan></text>
    <line x1="250" y1="152" x2="290" y2="152" class="ln" />
    <line x1="290" y1="70" x2="290" y2="234" class="ln" />
    <line x1="290" y1="70" x2="320" y2="70" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="330,70 320,65 320,75" class="hd" />
    <line x1="290" y1="234" x2="320" y2="234" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="330,234 320,229 320,239" class="hd" />
    <rect x="330" y="30" width="540" height="80" rx="10" class="redbox" />
    <text x="350" y="62" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>the two weak tests: still green</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hai test yếu: vẫn xanh</tspan></text>
    <text x="350" y="86" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>one mocks the service, one checks only the 201</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một cái mock service, một cái chỉ kiểm 201</tspan></text>
    <rect x="330" y="194" width="540" height="80" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="350" y="226" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>the suite from this post: red in 3 places</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bộ test của bài này: đỏ ở 3 chỗ</tspan></text>
    <text x="350" y="250" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>unit and API layers, each naming the broken rule</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tầng unit và API, mỗi chỗ gọi tên luật đã gãy</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Mutate, then watch: the tests that stay green after you break something are the ones that were checking nothing.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Phá rồi nhìn: những test vẫn xanh sau khi bạn phá code chính là những test không kiểm gì cả.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep9n7 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep9n7-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep9n7 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep9n7 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep9n7 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n7 .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n7 .bs { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep9n7 .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep9n7 .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep9n7 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep9n7 .redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n7 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep9n7 .redln { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n7 .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep9n7 .redhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n7 .bar { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep9n7 .redbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n7 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
